think Read REMEMBER (head), the 1024-round itinerary, the six-season double-seat, and the rye-first crypto parity wave. Season G (Cryptography) is the highest-Lindy open thread and the loop has been laddering primitives; the itinerary leaves the next rung to the loop's own honest opening.
think Witness before narrative — ran tools/crypto_suite_witness.rish first: all twenty-one existing files GREEN. Solid ground to accrete on.
think Read vendor/monocypher/src/monocypher.h for the genuinely-missing parity surface. The Monocypher-parity primitives the wave named (Ed25519, X25519, BLAKE2b, ChaCha/Poly) are all GREEN, yet the header still exposes crypto_eddsa_to_x25519 / crypto_x25519_to_eddsa — the birational key conversion. Chose it as the crux: highest Lindy because it unifies the identity story (Kumara's one Ed25519 key made usable for X25519 agreement), decisive, and fully agent-doable over TEST keys.
think Oracle design: Zig exposes no direct Edwards→Montgomery pubkey API, but a stronger independent oracle exists — Edwards25519.basePoint.clampedMul(s) and X25519.recoverPublicKey(s) clamp the same scalar identically, so eddsa_to_x25519(ed_pub) must equal the X25519 pubkey byte-for-byte. Plus the published RFC 7748 §4.1 checkpoint: the Edwards base's y = 4/5 maps to u = 9 exactly.
think Wrote crypto/ed25519_to_x25519.rye over the GREEN base field only — each map one add, one subtract, one inverse-multiply. from_bytes drops the Ed25519 sign bit; the reverse map packs sign-0. Each fn carries a construction invariant (field one canonical) and a postcondition invariant that verifies its own inverse against the field (u·(1−y)=1+y), guarded on the degenerate den=0 case. No std.crypto in the maps.
think Built GREEN on the first metal pass — RFC 7748 §4.1 base relationship, Zig cross-check across 24 clamped scalars both directions, and a reverse-then-forward round-trip recovering each u. tame_style bans clean, new file in no ratchet list.
think Wrote tools/crypto_ed25519_to_x25519_witness.rish (three-cell Language/Style/Lens shape), registered it after x25519 in crypto_suite_witness.rish (dependency order), updated suite counts (twenty-two files, nineteen primitives) and crypto/README.md (new key-agreement row, heading and choir counts).
obs GREEN on the first metal pass; whole suite re-proven GREEN across all twenty-two files. Purely local over TEST keys — no real identity key, no network, no funds, no real device. Converting the maintainer's own identity key stays the custody gate; the library builds and verifies. No custody gate reached this round.
